int-Makefile failure (RHEL-126049)</changelog>\n  <changelog author="Fr&#xE9;d&#xE9;ric B&#xE9;rat &lt;fberat@redhat.com&gt; - 2.39-86&#9;" date="1762344000">- Fix test-assert-2 failure (RHEL-126046)</changelog>\n</package>\n')
